[00:15.82]1. Our reasons for joy are abundant,
[00:20.68]Like riches increasing in worth.
[00:25.50]Those precious to God from all nations
[00:30.12]Are joining us in all the earth.
[00:34.88]The joy in our heart is well-founded,
[00:39.68]With roots reaching deep in God’s Word.
[00:44.98]We daily partake of its teachings;
[00:49.14]Faith follows the things we have heard.
[01:02.08]Our causes for joy are deep-seated,
[01:06.92]Like embers that burn in our hearts.
[01:11.46]Though troubles and trials beset us,
[01:16.32]Endurance Jehovah imparts.
[01:20.20](Chorus)
[01:20.32]Jehovah our God is our joy,
[01:24.72]The work of his hands our delight.
[01:29.48]How deep are his thoughts, how great are his works,
[01:34.50]Abounding in goodness and might!
[01:50.61]2. We gladly behold his productions,
[01:55.43]The heavens, the sea, and the land.
[02:00.05]We gaze at the book of creation,
[02:04.85]Applauding the work of his hands.
[02:09.53]Triumphantly we now bear witness,
[02:14.21]Proclaiming the Kingdom of God.
[02:18.59]The news of its birth and its blessings,
[02:23.87]We joyously spread all abroad.
[02:38.71]Eternal rejoicing approaches,
[02:42.79]Like daylight that follows the night.
[02:47.15]The promised new earth and new heavens
[02:51.85]Will bring everlasting delight.
[02:55.71](Chorus)
[02:55.93]Jehovah our God is our joy,
[02:59.95]The work of his hands our delight.
[03:04.51]How deep are his thoughts, how great are his works,
[03:09.81]Abounding in goodness and might!
